 Los Angeles because of her\ncareer, but Lucy wasn't entirely convinced that that wasn't just\nbravado. She had even told Nicole that just because she had a\ncareer she was not required to continue doing what she had\ndone\u2014or that she might still have a career, but a different one.\nNicole cried and said that she wanted to go back to Passionate\nIntensity. Piggy seconded this notion, emphatically, but Piggy\n207", "textLayer": [{"text": "the", "x": 7.39, "y": 5.9, "w": 3.74, "h": 1.58, "fontSize": 7.9}, {"text": "basket", "x": 12.32, "y": 5.9, "w": 7.49, "h": 1.58, "fontSize": 7.9}, {"text": "like", "x": 21.14, "y": 6.09, "w": 4.08, "h": 1.29, "fontSize": 6.4}, {"text": "someone", "x": 26.4, "y": 5.61, "w": 10.52, "h": 1.9, "fontSize": 9.5}, {"text": "in", "x": 38.1, "y": 6.07, "w": 2.09, "h": 1.32, "fontSize": 6.6}, {"text": "a", "x": 41.42, "y": 6.11, "w": 1.0, "h": 1.26, "fontSize": 6.3}, {"text": "contest,", "x": 43.55, "y": 5.89, "w": 9.34, "h": 1.48, "fontSize": 7.4}, {"text": "drawing", "x": 54.08, "y": 5.63, "w": 10.09, "h": 1.82, "fontSize": 9.1}, {"text": "a", "x": 65.31, "y": 6.11, "w": 1.0, "h": 1.26, "fontSize": 6.3}, {"text": "card.", "x": 67.44, "y": 5.93, "w": 5.78, "h": 1.46, "fontSize": 7.3}, {"text": "Mixed", "x": 74.55, "y": 5.57, "w": 7.68, "h": 1.94, "fontSize": 9.7}, {"text": "in", "x": 83.46, "y": 6.07, "w": 2.09, "h": 1.32, "fontSize": 6.6}, {"text": "with", "x": 7.44, "y": 7.97, "w": 5.4, "h": 1.71, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "all", "x": 14.12, "y": 8.42, "w": 2.61, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 5.5}, {"text": "the", "x": 18.01, "y": 8.08, "w": 3.7, "h": 1.56, "fontSize": 7.8}, {"text": "messages", "x": 22.99, "y": 7.95, "w": 10.95, "h": 1.73, "fontSize": 8.6}, {"text": "of", "x": 35.12, "y": 8.06, "w": 2.51, "h": 1.59, "fontSize": 7.9}, {"text": "condolence", "x": 38.53, "y": 7.91, "w": 13.74, "h": 1.74, "fontSize": 8.7}, {"text": "was", "x": 53.46, "y": 7.81, "w": 4.45, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 9.4}, {"text": "a", "x": 59.19, "y": 8.23, "w": 1